0..76 Comment "// The twin of `model/data/unfolded-arm.gandr`: the endpoint an arm hands to"
77..151 Comment "// another definition reads as that definition\'s call over the stuck call,"
152..228 Comment "// never as the stuck call alone, so a step that drops the call, or one that"
229..280 Comment "// takes a successor too many, is still told apart."
